{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "Peek Native (M2-B1 Lab)",
  "version": "0.10.0",
  "description": "Peek 原生承载模式（M1 工程底座）：在 X 详情页左侧提供由 DOM 提取的阅读栏，评论与互动由 X 原生承载。零私有接口桥接、零构造请求、零代点击。【实验构建：M2-B1 原生布局适配器已启用——左栏原生焦点帖 + 右栏原生评论；默认构建不含此模式。】",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://x.com/*",
        "https://twitter.com/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "layout-adapter-main.js"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_start",
      "world": "MAIN"
    },
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://x.com/*",
        "https://twitter.com/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "vendor/brand/icon.js",
        "content.js"
      ],
      "css": [
        "content.css"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    }
  ],
  "icons": {
    "16": "icons/icon16.png",
    "32": "icons/icon32.png",
    "48": "icons/icon48.png",
    "128": "icons/icon128.png"
  }
}
